flowchart TD
    A[Run or inspect an oracle] --> B{Any oracle non-null?}
    B -- No --> C[Q = UNMEASURED]
    C --> D[Cannot COMPLETE]
    B -- Yes --> E["Q = weighted mean of non-null oracles"]
    E --> F{Hard gate fails?}
    F -- Yes, new oracle, round < 3 --> G[One fix]
    F -- Yes, same oracle twice --> H[STALLED]
    F -- No --> I{Q meets risk floor?}
    I -- Yes --> J[COMPLETE]
    I -- No --> K[Not complete]
    L[Self 8-dimension card] --> M[Label only on /rdapq score]
    M --> N[Does not enter Q or exit]
